        "title": "Welcome to About You",
        "description": "This SmartUrbanity questionnaire collects basic personal, household and living-context information. Your answers help describe who participates in the study and how different urban conditions may affect daily mobility. Participation is voluntary and anonymous.\n\nhttps://www.smarturbanity.com/about",
